 = [%#salloc'6] UInt64.mul (UInt64.bw_xor ck v) (1099511628211: UInt64.t)

function fold_seq [#"/home/user/benchmark-verif/impls/rust/src/alloc.rs" 82 0 82 46] (sums: Seq.seq UInt64.t) (k: int) : UInt64.t

axiom fold_seq_def: forall sums: Seq.seq UInt64.t, k: int [fold_seq sums k]. ([%#salloc'3] 0 <= k
      /\ k <= Seq.length sums)
    -> fold_seq sums k
